<title>FRANCE: France reports bids for wheat, barley, rye.</title>
<headline>France reports bids for wheat, barley, rye.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exporters made the following bids for refunds to export free market grain at this week's EU tender, French cereals office ONIC said. Bids are in Ecus/tonne.</p>
<p>		     --- Oct 24 ---		 --- Oct 17---</p>
<p>MAIN TENDER</p>
<p>		 Tonnage  Range of Bids     Tonnage  Range of Bids</p>
<p> Soft wheat  624,000   8.49-19.90	 622,000   5.87-13.50</p>
<p> Barley	636,000  31.00-39.97	 278,000   29.95-35.94</p>
<p> Rye	    10,000  30.09-34.09	   9,000   Not given</p>
<p>ACP TENDER (open until October 31)</p>
<p> Soft wheat  No bids			   21,000   Not given</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
